        ("Ms Devonhollow", "That fee was added by mistake during checkout, removing it and refunding you now.", "Phí đó bị thêm nhầm lúc thanh toán, tôi xóa và hoàn tiền cho chị ngay."),
        # 23 deluxe barcode scanned for standard item
